WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.052 --> 00:00:05.089
Here come the blobs!

2
00:00:05.090 --> 00:00:09.348
What do they see?

3
00:00:09.349 --> 00:00:11.908
They see a bakery.

4
00:00:11.909 --> 00:00:24.466
The blobs go inside.

5
00:00:24.467 --> 00:00:40.459
They taste bread.

6
00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:58.369
They taste cookies.

7
00:00:58.370 --> 00:01:21.489
They taste donuts.

8
00:01:21.490 --> 00:01:38.336
They taste pies.

9
00:01:38.337 --> 00:01:51.812
They taste cupcakes.

10
00:01:51.813 --> 00:02:11.707
They taste cake.

11
00:02:11.708 --> 00:02:26.989
Blobs, don't play with frosting!

12
00:02:26.990 --> 00:02:39.400
Silly blobs.

13
00:02:39.401 --> 00:02:42.953
Good-bye!

